              "id": "1",
              "content": "<p class=\"mb-4\">She looks like someone that I <u>know well</u>. (Hint: fa...) [ 1 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Drinking water is something that she <u>must do</u>. (Hint: ne...) [ 2 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">He has an <u>idea</u> of how the machine works. (Hint: th...) [ 3 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">The <u>reason</u> that I am doing this is to help children. (Hint: pu...) [ 4 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">My teacher will <u>make me want to</u> get good grades. (Hint: en...) [ 5 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">I <u>agree with</u> your idea. I think it will work. (Hint: ac...) [ 6 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">It is difficult to <u>keep from falling</u> when you stand on one foot. (Hint: ba...) [ 7 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Her <u>routine</u> of exercising after work is common for many people. (Hint: pa...) [ 8 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">There is a big <u>difference</u> between day and night. (Hint: co...) [ 9 ]</p><p class=\"mb-4\">The Earth has a <u>solitary</u> moon. (Hint: si...) [ 10 ]</p>",
              "explanation": "Câu này đúng vì phù hợp với ngữ cảnh của bài.",
              "correctAnswer": "familiar"
